  "text": "COMMONWEALTH OF AUSTRALIA.\nAUSTRALIA HOUSE,\nLONDON, W.C.2\n15th June, 1955.\nC.H. McFadyen Esq., C.B.E.,\nSecretary,\nDepartment of Shipping & Transport,\nRialto Building,\n497 Collins Street,\nMELBOURNE.\nDear Mr. McFadyen,\nI read with pleasure\nbestowed upon you by\n• the Queen in her\nBirthday Honours List, may I offer you\ncongratulations on this well merited\naward for the great service you have\ngiven to the Commonwealth Government.\nYours sincerely,\nD.K. BARKER)\nPUBLIC SERVICE BOARD REPRESENTATIVE\nN.G. DUFFY\nAND fOUNG BILL (SMTHS)",
